OL,6,GThank you for your hard work on making 
OL,7,Ga Teletext service with up to date     
OL,8,Ginformation! Now to get a Raspberry Pi 
OL,9,Gset up!                          CBilly
OL,11,GI was amazed when I first discovered   
OL,12,Gceefax on a trip to England in 1999. I 
OL,13,Gstill don't know why it never existed  
OL,14,Gin the US.                 CThorfinn911
OL,16,GWhat a fantastic thing you have done.  
OL,17,GLong may it continue.                  
OL,18,                     CMegadigitaldavemk2
OL,21,                                  G12/15
