OL,6,GThank you - finding your Ceefax site   
OL,7,Ghas brought back many happy memories!  
OL,8,                                CMatthew
OL,10,GCeefax is a great way to get a news    
OL,11,Gdigest. I built the Wireless World     
OL,12,Gdecoder decades ago, and won the first 
OL,13,GCeefax crossword competition.     CTony
OL,14,                                  CAbbey
OL,16,GNMS Ceefax is far superior to any new- 
OL,17,Gfangled Red Button Service. CPaul Retro
